    <li><a href={`${base}docs/guide/install-host/`}>Install the host</a></li>
    <li><a href={`${base}docs/guide/install-ios/`}>Install on iOS</a></li>
    <li><a href={`${base}docs/guide/pairing/`}>Pairing</a></li>
    <li><a href={`${base}docs/reference/troubleshooting/`}>Troubleshooting</a></li>
  </ul>
  <p>
    The protocol and security docs are under Reference, and the architecture is under Internals.
  </p>
</Doc>
